  <data name="Mod_project_pipeline_Scope" xml:space="preserve"><value>Read-only only. PIPELINE / NOT FINAL ASSET / DO NOT WRITE stay explicit. This is for lineage, descriptors, and support carriers, not for patching or repacking.</value></data>
  <data name="Mod_project_pipeline_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Extras / Project / Pipeline</value></data>
  <data name="Mod_project_pipeline_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Inspect proj, cdrom.*, eiichi_abmap_data, and ABMap lineage as build/index/pipeline surfaces instead of pretending those files are final runtime assets.</value></data>
