  <data name="Mod_magic_viewer_web_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>Leitor embarcado das magias FFXMagicViewerWeb: Runtime DLL Map primeiro, depois Package Graph, Texture Stack, Runtime Evidence e Crosswalk.</value></data>
